$ with_analysis_both An analysis content should be found
j: analysis
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, pos 0
j: analysis.clusters[0][0]: clone_shared_main
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, pos 1
j: analysis.clusters[0][1]: clone_shared_sub2
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, pos 2
j: analysis.clusters[0][2]: clone_shared_sub3
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, pos 3
j: analysis.clusters[0][3]: clone_shared_sub4A
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, pos 4
j: analysis.clusters[0][4]: clone_shared_sub4B
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 1 content should be correct, not 6th element
j0: analysis.clusters[0][5]


$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 2 content should be correct, pos 0
j: analysis.clusters[1][0]: clone_5A
$ with_analysis_both Analysis cluster 2 content should be correct, pos 1
j: analysis.clusters[1][1]: clone_6A


